==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Cannot use [[Bebe (Uber Rare Cat)|Bebe]]

==Battleground==
*10 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dessert Witch - Obsession]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**12 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

